67:    ? "Version B — a separate opt-in reading list"
68:    : "Version A — every link has a read / to-read status";
70:  // mode A: state = "toread" | "read" on every item (all start toread)
71:  // mode B: inList = boolean (saved but not queued unless added); done = boolean
